OL,3,GNEWSAInquest to be held nearly nine
OL,4,Ayears after arson murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest is to be held into the
OL,7,Fdeaths of a mother and her four
OL,8,Fchildren murdered in an arson attack
OL,9,Falmost nine years on from the incident.
OL,11,FThe blaze in December 2017 claimed the
OL,12,Flives of Demi Pearson, 15, her brother
OL,13,FBrandon, eight, and sisters Lacie,
OL,14,Fseven, and Lia, three.
OL,16,FTheir mother, Michelle Pearson,
OL,17,Fsuffered 68% burns to her body and
OL,18,F"clung on to life" until she died, aged
OL,19,F37, on 25 August, 2019 ` 20 months
OL,20,Fafter the attack in Walkden, Greater
OL,21,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
