OL,3,GNEWSAInquest to be held nearly nine
OL,4,Ayears after arson murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FTimothy Brennand, senior coroner for
OL,7,FManchester West, has set a date of 5
OL,8,FOctober for the inquest to begin.
